WEBVTT

00:05:58.663 --> 00:06:02.204
I decided to take a break from
an all nighter and go to

00:06:02.204 --> 00:06:07.871
a lecture by Dr. Paul Farmer, a leading
health activist for the global poor.

00:06:08.163 --> 00:06:11.663
And I was surprised to hear a doctor
talking about architecture.

00:06:11.996 --> 00:06:14.246
Buildings are making people sicker,
he said.

00:06:14.454 --> 00:06:18.996
And for the poorest in the world, this
is causing epidemic level problems.

00:06:19.538 --> 00:06:22.579
In this hospital in South Africa,
patients that came in with, say,

00:06:22.579 --> 00:06:27.413
a broken leg to wait in this unventilated
hallway walked out with

00:06:27.413 --> 00:06:30.371
a multidrug resistant strand
of tuberculosis.